[size=5]Description[/size]
Focus Loot Outline highlights loot, useful objects, and hazards while you are in focus mode, so you can spot supplies and plan a route around danger. Loot, stations, and objectives default to pale warm gold; carryable fuel cans and supply bags glow green; dangers glow red. The highlights go dark when you leave focus.

Built for loot goblins who will not leave a map until every last container is searched.

[size=5]Main features[/size]
[list]
[*]Highlights searchable containers, corpses, stashes, supply caches, gated containers, pickups, stations, and objectives through walls during focus.
[*]Marks burning ground, acid and infection clouds or puddles, explosive barrels and fuel tanks, traps, tripwires, and mines in red.
[*]Shows flat ground discs for active ground hazards and the blast radius of a placed Box Mine. Buried proximity mines highlight their device mesh.
[*]Skips searched containers by default, with settings to change colors, brightness, and which groups light up.
[/list]

[size=5]Requirements[/size]
[list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/thelaststandaftermath/mods/1]BepInEx for The Last Stand: Aftermath[/url]. Install it first.
[/list]

[size=5]Installation[/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/thelaststandaftermath/mods/1]BepInEx[/url] [i](if no other mods were installed before, start the game once so BepInEx finishes setup, then quit)[/i].
[*]Extract this mod's zip into the game folder (the folder with the game .exe). The DLL lands in BepInEx\plugins. Full path examples:
[list]
[*]Steam: [code]C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\The Last Stand Aftermath\BepInEx\plugins\FocusLootOutline.dll[/code]
[*]Epic: [code]C:\Program Files\Epic Games\The Last Stand Aftermath\BepInEx\plugins\FocusLootOutline.dll[/code]
[/list]
[*]Start the game. Enter focus mode near loot and containers now outline.
[/list]

[size=5]Uninstall[/size]
Delete FocusLootOutline.dll from the BepInEx\plugins folder.

[size=5]Configuration[/size]
To change mod settings, edit [font=Courier New]BepInEx\config\com.ivmakk.tlsa.focuslootoutline.cfg[/font] (see [url=https://github.com/ivmakk-tlsa/tlsa-focus-loot-outline/blob/main/CONFIG.md]CONFIG.md[/url] for every setting).

Restart the game after editing.

